      "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
      "body": "Closing: the no-backoff reconnect storm this describes is resolved on main. #4344 (merged) rewrote the workspace SSE reader to stop on 4xx and honor 503, and the reconnect path now uses jittered, coalesced retries (generation-guarded) with a degraded state after repeated failures (workspace-file-events.ts). #4344 was marked as completing this issue.\n\nRemaining refinement: exponential backoff (#4340) is still open, but the fixed-interval no-backoff amplification this issue is about no longer occurs. Reopen if the storm recurs.",
